    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aPONPON TOWN\u300b is a desktop idle game that you can play while you are doing other things! Collect over a dozen adorable marble animal villagers, gather resources, and build your village\u2014all without interrupting your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/27b77e048d421df13e805686da52dd0c.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/27b77e048d421df13e805686da52dd0c.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/27b77e048d421df13e805686da52dd0c.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/52b6191d3bbde484a22687968f48b42f.avif?t=1755589953\" width=740 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball villagers roll and collide to produce coins, wood, and mysterious materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to launch: recruit an animal team and use the cat paw button to explode with resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise events: steal the banana from the little monkey carrying it, awaken budding sunflowers, and smash troublesome fences to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/98ce5397c088450c9e52a929b07fd1d4.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=198 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/98ce5397c088450c9e52a929b07fd1d4.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/98ce5397c088450c9e52a929b07fd1d4.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/457b705c257d186828a916b3e2936f24.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=198 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/457b705c257d186828a916b3e2936f24.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/457b705c257d186828a916b3e2936f24.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/89a76444740334648ed10d100187182f.avif?t=1755589953\" width=740 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Round hamsters, smelly piglets, laid-back capybaras\u2026 dozens of adorable villagers with unique talents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fancy jobs: each animal has its own special work skill and a full personality score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Keyboard boost: pound the keyboard to speed up the hamster expedition\u2014the harder you hit, the faster they run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/81157990c7692e9c50d3ac9bcbcacd38.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/81157990c7692e9c50d3ac9bcbcacd38.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/81157990c7692e9c50d3ac9bcbcacd38.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/2b6a3c2aed964d52eefb324921a01394.avif?t=1755589953\" width=740 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag and place buildings to decorate a unique village, with workshops and taverns rising from the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Worry-free idle mode: make full use of your desktop space, freely adjust size and position, and relax even while working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Villager arrival: the more facilities you have, the livelier the animals\u2019 gathering in the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f3594c04d3fc8b8b39d59f2e3587b5cf.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f3594c04d3fc8b8b39d59f2e3587b5cf.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f3594c04d3fc8b8b39d59f2e3587b5cf.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/92b15b2c0695fdfb809737479ba574a4.avif?t=1755589953\" width=740 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing mini-games keep being added! Surprise easter eggs are hidden in every corner!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aPONPON TOWN\u300b is a desktop idle game that you can play while you are doing other things! Collect over a dozen adorable marble animal villagers, gather resources, and build your village\u2014all without interrupting your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/27b77e048d421df13e805686da52dd0c.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/27b77e048d421df13e805686da52dd0c.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/27b77e048d421df13e805686da52dd0c.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/52b6191d3bbde484a22687968f48b42f.avif?t=1755589953\" width=740 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball villagers roll and collide to produce coins, wood, and mysterious materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to launch: recruit an animal team and use the cat paw button to explode with resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise events: steal the banana from the little monkey carrying it, awaken budding sunflowers, and smash troublesome fences to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/98ce5397c088450c9e52a929b07fd1d4.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=198 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s