.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/81157990c7692e9c50d3ac9bcbcacd38.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/81157990c7692e9c50d3ac9bcbcacd38.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/2b6a3c2aed964d52eefb324921a01394.avif?t=1755589953\" width=740 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag and place buildings to decorate a unique village, with workshops and taverns rising from the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Worry-free idle mode: make full use of your desktop space, freely adjust size and position, and relax even while working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Villager arrival: the more facilities you have, the livelier the animals\u2019 gathering in the village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f3594c04d3fc8b8b39d59f2e3587b5cf.poster.avif?t=1755589953\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f3594c04d3fc8b8b39d59f2e3587b5cf.webm?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/f3594c04d3fc8b8b39d59f2e3587b5cf.mp4?t=1755589953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687170/extras/92b15b2c0695fdfb809737479ba574a4.avif?t=1755589953\" width=740 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing mini-games keep being added! Surprise easter eggs are hidden in every corner!</p>",
